{"id":"50ccfcdcd428a34e","group":"14","path":"14/14-thm-geometric-sequent-completeness.md","title":"Theorem — 有穷几何序列的完全性","display":"Theorem — 有穷几何序列的完全性","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Sheaves in Geometry and Logic (Mac Lane & Moerdijk)","book_abbrev":"14","label":"14-thm-geometric-sequent-completeness","aliases":["14-thm-geometric-sequent-completeness"],"display":"Theorem — 有穷几何序列的完全性","depends_on":["[[14-df-finitary-geometric-deduction]]","[[14-df-first-order-categorical-semantics]]","[[14-df-model-homomorphisms-and-category]]","[[14-df-giraud-grothendieck-topos]]","[[14-thm-geometric-deduction-soundness]]","[[14-thm-existence-classifying-topos]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Sheaves in Geometry and Logic (Mac Lane &amp; Moerdijk)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"14"},{"key":"label","html":"14-thm-geometric-sequent-completeness"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>14-thm-geometric-sequent-completeness</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"Theorem — 有穷几何序列的完全性"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"f9eae1f4309444c6\" href=\"?note=f9eae1f4309444c6\" title=\"14-df-finitary-geometric-deduction\">14-df-finitary-geometric-deduction</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"c22badb838a7fca1\" href=\"?note=c22badb838a7fca1\" title=\"14-df-first-order-categorical-semantics\">14-df-first-order-categorical-semantics</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"fc5aaf8518e020c2\" href=\"?note=fc5aaf8518e020c2\" title=\"14-df-model-homomorphisms-and-category\">14-df-model-homomorphisms-and-category</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"2e748a8b3caef6a6\" href=\"?note=2e748a8b3caef6a6\" title=\"14-df-giraud-grothendieck-topos\">14-df-giraud-grothendieck-topos</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"0ae924f79f9fa3bb\" href=\"?note=0ae924f79f9fa3bb\" title=\"14-thm-geometric-deduction-soundness\">14-thm-geometric-deduction-soundness</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"870f44eeb18d8969\" href=\"?note=870f44eeb18d8969\" title=\"14-thm-existence-classifying-topos\">14-thm-existence-classifying-topos</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb T\">\\(\\mathbb T\\)</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal U\">\\(\\mathcal U\\)</span>-小有穷几何理论；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma=(\\varphi\\vdash_{\\vec x}\\psi)\\in\\operatorname{Seq}_S\">\\(\\sigma=(\\varphi\\vdash_{\\vec x}\\psi)\\in\\operatorname{Seq}_S\\)</span>；演绎见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"f9eae1f4309444c6\" href=\"?note=f9eae1f4309444c6\" title=\"14-df-finitary-geometric-deduction\">14-df-finitary-geometric-deduction</a>，解释见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"c22badb838a7fca1\" href=\"?note=c22badb838a7fca1\" title=\"14-df-first-order-categorical-semantics\">14-df-first-order-categorical-semantics</a>。</li>\n<li>模型范畴采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"fc5aaf8518e020c2\" href=\"?note=fc5aaf8518e020c2\" title=\"14-df-model-homomorphisms-and-category\">14-df-model-homomorphisms-and-category</a>，量化仅遍历 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal U\">\\(\\mathcal U\\)</span>-Grothendieck 拓扑斯。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Provable}_{\\mathrm{Geo}}(\\mathbb T,\\sigma)\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall\\mathcal E\\ \\bigl(\\mathrm{IsGrothendieckTopos}(\\mathcal E)\\Rightarrow\\forall M\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathrm{Mod}_{\\mathbb T}(\\mathcal E))\\ ⟦\\varphi⟧_{M,\\vec x}\\le⟦\\psi⟧_{M,\\vec x}\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Provable}_{\\mathrm{Geo}}(\\mathbb T,\\sigma)\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall\\mathcal E\\ \\bigl(\\mathrm{IsGrothendieckTopos}(\\mathcal E)\\Rightarrow\\forall M\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathrm{Mod}_{\\mathbb T}(\\mathcal E))\\ ⟦\\varphi⟧_{M,\\vec x}\\le⟦\\psi⟧_{M,\\vec x}\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>依据原书 X.5 的 Gentzen 语法站点构造及 X.7 的泛模型判据整理。正向由 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"0ae924f79f9fa3bb\" href=\"?note=0ae924f79f9fa3bb\" title=\"14-thm-geometric-deduction-soundness\">14-thm-geometric-deduction-soundness</a> 的规则归纳；逆向取语法分类拓扑斯的泛模型，可表对象的包含由 Yoneda 全忠实性还原为语法序列可导。原稿缺上下文和结论公式，并用未定义的 Geo 可证谓词，已补闭合。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"14-df-finitary-geometric-deduction","status":"resolved","id":"f9eae1f4309444c6","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-finitary-geometric-deduction]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-first-order-categorical-semantics","status":"resolved","id":"c22badb838a7fca1","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-first-order-categorical-semantics]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-model-homomorphisms-and-category","status":"resolved","id":"fc5aaf8518e020c2","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-model-homomorphisms-and-category]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-giraud-grothendieck-topos","status":"resolved","id":"2e748a8b3caef6a6","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-giraud-grothendieck-topos]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-thm-geometric-deduction-soundness","status":"resolved","id":"0ae924f79f9fa3bb","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-thm-geome