\sigma)\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall\\mathcal E\\ \\bigl(\\mathrm{IsGrothendieckTopos}(\\mathcal E)\\Rightarrow\\forall M\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathrm{Mod}_{\\mathbb T}(\\mathcal E))\\ ⟦\\varphi⟧_{M,\\vec x}\\le⟦\\psi⟧_{M,\\vec x}\\bigr).","display":true}],"bytes":1607,"backlinks":[{"id":"c53146be63465990","anchor":"ref-207","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-thm-geometric-sequent-completeness|Theorem — 有穷几何序列的完全性]]"},{"id":"4741fef73eb1a614","anchor":"ref-85","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-thm-geometric-sequent-completeness]]"},{"id":"c60ad289d123497b","anchor":"ref-208","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-thm-geometric-sequent-completeness|Theorem — 有穷几何序列的完全性]]"},{"id":"0ed40e4b73b2ad9a","anchor":"ref-14","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"精确来源：原书 X.7 Corollary 2，印刷 p.569，并结合语法推导判据。分类拓扑斯可相干呈现（[[14-thm-coherent-classifying-topos]]），Deligne 定理给足够多点；各点将泛模型拉回为集合模型。若所有集合模型满足，则点反射泛模型中子对象包含，再由[[14-thm-geometric-sequent-completeness]]得到可导。只适用于这里的有穷几何片段。"}],"outgoing":["f9eae1f4309444c6","c22badb838a7fca1","fc5aaf8518e020c2","2e748a8b3caef6a6","0ae924f79f9fa3bb","870f44eeb18d8969"]}